{"full":"hf:YorozuyaLabs/steganogan","spaceId":"YorozuyaLabs/steganogan","name":"Steganography Gan Project","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":4,"created":"2026-05-17T18:14:17.000Z","updated":"2026-06-27T05:57:20.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://yorozuyalabs-steganogan.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/YorozuyaLabs/steganogan","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:43.333Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:43.333Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:43.333Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🏢","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A state-of-the-art Generative Adversarial Network (GAN) architecture paired with robust Error Correction Codes (ECC) for imperceptible and secure data hiding.","View Demo (Hugging Face Space) • Report Bug • Request Feature","SteganoGAN is a full-stack web application that leverages deep learning to dynamically embed and retrieve secret text payloads within digital cover images. Unlike traditional spatial methods (like LSB substitution) that are vulnerable to statistical steganalysis, this system utilizes a tripartite adversarial network to weave data directly into the image's high-frequency spatial features."],"features":["Visual Imperceptibility: Achieves >0.95 Structural Similarity Index (SSIM). The human eye cannot detect the embedded payload.","Adversarial Security: Trained against a Spectral-Normalized DenseNet discriminator to ensure the embedded data bypasses standard steganalysis detection.","Compression Resilience: Custom 3x Repetition ECC with mathematical majority voting automatically repairs bit-flip errors caused by channel transmission or localized cropping.","Full-Stack Deployment: Dockerized environment featuring a React frontend and a Python/Flask REST API backend."